  !>
  %-  trim
  %+  check:check
    '---- MODULE spec ----\0aEXTENDS Naturals\0aVARIABLE x, y\0aInit == x = 0 /\\ y = 0\0aNext == /\\ x\' = (x + 1) % 3\0a        /\\ y\' = (y + 1) % 2\0aInv == x < 3\0aVw == x\0a====\0a'
  'INIT Init\0aNEXT Next\0aINVARIANT Inv\0a'
